{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/guidance/how-to-complete-your-self-assessment-tax-return-for-last-tax-year","content_id":"0a71efff-130c-48e0-bd40-09ca5900efc1","description":"How to report your income and claim tax reliefs and any repayment due to you using the SA100 tax return, for 6 April 2025 to 5 April 2026.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"different.format@hmrc.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"69c14d07cfa346b9d4704a8d","filename":"SA100-2026.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":1356263,"filename":"SA100-2026.pdf","id":"9488135","number_of_pages":10,"title":"SA100 tax return (2026)","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69c14d07cfa346b9d4704a8d/SA100-2026.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"different.format@hmrc.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"69c14db1cfa346b9d4704a94","filename":"SA100-Cymraeg-2026.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":855058,"filename":"SA100-Cymraeg-2026.pdf","id":"9488137","number_of_pages":10,"title":"SA100 Ffurflen Dreth (2026)","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69c14db1cfa346b9d4704a94/SA100-Cymraeg-2026.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"different.format@hmrc.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a9ea8a5df4246cf45e469e0","filename":"SA150_Notes_2026.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":965576,"filename":"SA150_Notes_2026.pdf","id":"9490366","number_of_pages":18,"title":"How to fill in your tax return (2026)","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a9ea8a5df4246cf45e469e0/SA150_Notes_2026.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"different.format@hmrc.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a9ea921f5b35599aec192c4","filename":"SA150_Notes_2026_Cymraeg.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":665121,"filename":"SA150_Notes_2026_Cymraeg.pdf","id":"9490616","number_of_pages":18,"title":"Sut i gwblhau eich Ffurflen Dreth (2026)","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a9ea921f5b35599aec192c4/SA150_Notes_2026_Cymraeg.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\">\n<div role=\"note\" aria-label=\"Information\" class=\"application-notice info-notice\">\n  <p>You can find <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/complete-your-self-assessment-tax-return-for-5-april-2024-or-earlier\">tax returns for 5 April 2025 or earlier</a>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"file-online\">File online</h2>\n<p>You can <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/log-in-file-self-assessment-tax-return\">file your tax return online</a> — 97% of people already do it this way.</p>\n\n<p>If you file your tax return online:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>it’s easier to make amendments and more secure</li>\n  <li>you’ll have an extra 3 months to send it to us</li>\n  <li>you do not have to complete it all at once — you can save your details and finish it later</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"how-to-fill-in-your-tax-return\">How to fill in your tax return</h2>\n\n<p>Find guidance to help you understand and <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/collections/get-help-filling-in-your-self-assessment-tax-return\">fill in the sections of your Self Assessment tax return</a>.</p>\n\n<p>You can also use the guidance notes to help you fill in your tax return.</p>\n\n<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a9ea8a5df4246cf45e469e0/SA150_Notes_2026.pdf\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image--pdf\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 99 140\" width=\"99\" height=\"140\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <path d=\"M12,59h9v9h-9v-9ZM30,77v9h39v-9H30ZM30,104h57v-9H30v9ZM30,122h48v-9H30v9ZM12,86h9v-9h-9v9ZM12,122h9v-9h-9v9ZM12,104h9v-9h-9v9ZM30,68h57v-9H30v9ZM35.2,21c-.3-.2-.6-.4-1-.5s-.8-.2-1.3-.2h-2.6v5.5h2.6c.5,0,1,0,1.3-.2s.7-.3,1-.5c.3-.2.5-.5.7-.8s.2-.7.2-1.1h0c0-.5,0-.9-.2-1.2-.2-.3-.4-.6-.7-.8h0ZM52.4,21.9c-.4-.5-1-.9-1.6-1.1-.7-.3-1.5-.4-2.4-.4h-2.7v11.5h2.7c.9,0,1.7-.1,2.4-.4s1.2-.7,1.6-1.1c.4-.5.7-1.1.9-1.7.2-.7.3-1.4.3-2.1v-.7c0-.8,0-1.5-.3-2.1-.2-.6-.5-1.2-.9-1.7h0ZM87,12v27H12V12h75ZM39.8,23c0-.9-.1-1.6-.4-2.4-.3-.7-.7-1.4-1.2-1.9-.5-.5-1.2-1-1.9-1.2-.8-.3-1.6-.5-2.5-.5h-7.2v17.9h3.6v-6h3.2c.9,0,1.8-.1,2.6-.5.8-.3,1.4-.7,2-1.2.5-.5,1-1.2,1.3-1.9.3-.7.5-1.5.5-2.4h0ZM57.4,26c0-1.3-.2-2.6-.5-3.7s-.9-2-1.6-2.8c-.7-.8-1.6-1.4-2.7-1.8-1.1-.4-2.3-.6-3.8-.6h-6.6v17.9h6.6c1.5,0,2.7-.2,3.8-.6,1.1-.4,2-1,2.7-1.8.7-.8,1.3-1.7,1.6-2.8.4-1.1.5-2.3.5-3.7h0ZM72.4,17.1h-12.1v17.9h3.6v-7.5h7.8v-3.3h-7.8v-3.8h8.4s0-3.3,0-3.3Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</a>\n</div>\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__details\">\n    <h2 class=\"gem-c-attachment__title\">\n      <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a9ea8a5df4246cf45e469e0/SA150_Notes_2026.pdf\">How to fill in your tax return (2026)</a>\n</h2>\n\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\"><abbr title=\"Portable Document Format\" class=\"gem-c-attachment__abbr\">PDF</abbr></span>, <span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\">943 KB</span>, <span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\">18 pages</span></p>\n\n\n\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\">This file may not be suitable for users of assistive technology.</p>\n      <details data-module=\"ga4-event-tracker\" data-ga4-event='{\"event_name\":\"select_content\",\"type\":\"detail\",\"text\":\"Request an accessible format.\",\"section\":\"Request an accessible format.\",\"index_section\":1}' class=\"gem-c-details govuk-details govuk-!-margin-bottom-0\" title=\"Request an accessible format.\">\n  <summary class=\"govuk-details__summary\">\n    <span class=\"govuk-details__summary-text\" data-ga4-expandable>\n      Request an accessible format.\n    </span>\n</summary>  <div class=\"govuk-details__text\">\n    \n        If you use assistive technology (such as a screen reader) and need a version of this document in a more accessible format, please email <a href=\"mailto:different.format@hmrc.gov.uk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"govuk-link\">different.format@hmrc.gov.uk</a>. Please tell us what format you need. It will help us if you say what assistive technology you use.\n\n  </div>\n</details>\n</div></section>\n\n<h2 id=\"get-supplementary-pages\">Get supplementary pages</h2>\n\n<p>You may need to fill in and send additional forms, known as supplementary pages, along with your SA100 tax return.</p>\n\n<p>There are supplementary forms if you are:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>an employee or company director —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-employment-sa102\">SA102: Employment</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>a clergyman or a minister of religion —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-ministers-of-religion-sa102m\">SA102M: Ministers of religion</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>a member of Parliament (MP) or a minister —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-parliament-sa102mp\">SA102MP: Parliament</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>a member of the Senedd Cymru (Welsh Parliament) —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-the-national-assembly-for-wales-sa102wam\">SA102MS: The National Assembly of Wales</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>a member of the Northern Ireland Legislative Assembly —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-northern-ireland-legislative-assembly-sa102mla\">SA102MLA: Northern Ireland Legislative Assembly</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>a member of the Scottish Parliament —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-scottish-parliament-sa102msp\">SA102MSP: Scottish Parliament</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>an underwriting member of Lloyd’s —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-lloyds-underwriters-sa103l\">SA103L: Lloyd’s underwriters</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>a non-UK resident or dual resident —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-residence-remittance-basis-etc-sa109\">SA109: Residence, remittance basis etc</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>There are also supplementary forms if you need to record:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>less common types of income, deductions and tax reliefs —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-additional-information-sa101\">SA101: Additional information</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>self-employment income —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-self-employment-short-sa103s\">SA103S: Self-employment (short)</a> or <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-self-employment-full-sa103f\">SA103F: Self-employment (full)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>partnership income —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-partnership-short-sa104s\">SA104S: Partnership (short)</a> or <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-partnership-full-sa104f\">SA104F:Partnership (full)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>UK property income —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-uk-property-sa105\">SA105: UK property</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>foreign income or gains —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-foreign-sa106\">SA106: Foreign</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>income you received from a trust, settlement or deceased person’s estate —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-trusts-etc-sa107\">SA107: Trusts etc</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>capital gains and losses —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-capital-gains-summary-sa108\">SA108: Capital Gains summary</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>the results of your tax calculation —<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/self-assessment-tax-calculation-summary-sa110\">SA110: Tax calculation</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"if-you-complete-a-paper-tax-return\">If you complete a paper tax return</h2>\n\n<p>You’ll need to post your tax return to <abbr title=\"HM Revenue and Customs\">HMRC</abbr>.</p>\n\n<p>If you live in the UK send to:</p>\n\n<div class=\"address\"><div class=\"adr org fn\"><p>\nSelf Assessment<br>HM Revenue &amp; Customs<br>BX9 1AS<br>United Kingdom\n</p></div></div>\n\n<p>If you live outside the UK send to:</p>\n\n<div class=\"address\"><div class=\"adr org fn\"><p>\nHM Revenue &amp; Customs<br>Benton Park View<br>Newcastle Upon Tyne<br>NE98 1ZZ<br>United Kingdom\n</p></div></div>\n\n<p><abbr title=\"HM Revenue and Customs\">HMRC</abbr> must receive your paper tax return <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/self-assessment-tax-returns/deadlines\">by the deadline</a>.</p>\n\n<p>If you miss the paper filing deadline, <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/log-in-file-self-assessment-tax-return\">send your tax return online</a> instead to avoid a penalty.</p>\n\n<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69c14d07cfa346b9d4704a8d/SA100-2026.pdf\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-